{"title": "Slow: Casting", "pageid": 51301, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Slow:_Casting", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Slow.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Slow.webp/300px-Slow.webp, /w/images/5/5f/Slow.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Slow.webp/300px-Slow.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Slow.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Slow: Casting</b> is a passive feature applied to a target afflicted with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Slowed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slowed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Slowed (Condition)\">Slowed</a> and is a component of the Slow effect.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If you cast a spell that costs 1 <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>, roll a d20. On 11 or higher, you hang in prepare phase and skip turn. On your next turn you must spend an action point and finish casting. If you don't have an action point, the spell is cancelled. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Applied to creatures afflicted with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Slowed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slowed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Slowed (Condition)\">Slowed</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This passive is non-functional and hence the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Slowed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slowed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Slowed (Condition)\">Slowed</a> condition does not affect spellcasting in the way that is described.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715010636\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1256/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9078/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4180/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1060667/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.187      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.187      1 -total\n 54.07%   22.271      3 Template:SmCond\n 44.71%   18.414      1 Template:PageSeo\n 43.99%   18.117      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.97%    6.98